"title":"Sumika Sumire","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk59/shows/cfb32d5a-1d93-482b-9d5d-4a02147e2a69.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk51/seasons/e0dde657-0b7d-48be-bbd2-5ca4d65fd712.jpg","likes":20,"dislikes":0,"views":1941,"release_date":"1451606400000","season_number":1,"description":"Kisaragi Sumi is a 20-year-old university student. But do not be surprised that she is a 65-year-old inside. Under pressure to help out with the family business from a young age, she could not have a youth. Even afterwards, she devoted her entire life to taking care of first her grandmother and then her father and mother. Sumi finds herself turning 65 without ever having had a boyfriend. She takes a little pride in having lived with integrity. But after her mother passes away, she has the sudden thought of regaining her youth once more and making a fresh start in life. A miracle happens to her. One day when Sumi wakes up, she has the appearance of a 20-year-old. Despite being bewildered by this unbelievable reality, she introduces herself as Sumire and gets another try at youth.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8}],"value":8,"age":"R"},"current_season_id":7047,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}